# Punctuation in copy

Do not use an em dash (`—`) or an en dash (`–`) in UI copy, metadata, aria labels, or comments we write.

Use a regular hyphen (`-`), with the same spacing the sentence already has.

```
# Bad
DAJMI — Ovlašćeni Škoda servis
08:00 — 17:00
Pon–Sub
Za servis, tehnički pregled ili informacije — tu smo u Mokrinama.

# Good
DAJMI - Ovlašćeni Škoda servis
08:00 - 17:00
Pon-Sub
Za servis, tehnički pregled ili informacije - tu smo u Mokrinama.
```

Leave the auto-generated Next.js block in `AGENTS.md` alone; `next dev` rewrites it.
